", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. Deploy history shows v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc as unhealthy; v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions; rollback completed and was verified (us-east, us-west, eu-west now on v2.3.0). Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 53719, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YFD7CnHo9d61T7YvM8MCxL", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53719, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YFD7CnHo9d61T7YvM8MCxL", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 57523, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy in the deploy history. Both v2.3.1 and its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, are marked unhealthy.\n- **After:** All three regions are on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback and the result. It also notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 problem needs to be found before it's deployed again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "to