et_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy in the deploy history. Both v2.3.1 and its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, are marked unhealthy.\n- **After:** All three regions are on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback and the result. It also notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 problem needs to be found before it's deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}